{"version":1,"content":"<p>EA被沙特一家基金收購，公司迎來重大轉折。當時外界就擔憂，這筆收購會帶來項目取消、工作室關停。如今隨着BioWare正式關閉，最壞的猜想已然成為現實。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583538.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:50.485814+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_hash":"111ad69e955d1554bd72e10613c646b19cbd75da156e7b9250c55307d46ac6c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}